<|SECTION:TASK|>
Sentences written for an invented fantasy world use names that must be replaced. For each numbered item, pick the one invented name from its list that suits the sentence best{% if language %} (they come from {{ language }}{% if sound %}, which sounds like this: {{ sound }}{% endif %}){% endif %}. When the item names a man or a woman, pick a name that suits them.

