{% for word in words -%}
- {{ word.word }}: {{ word.meanings|join("; ") }}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}
The items:
{% for item in items -%}
{{ item.n }}. Sentence: {{ item.sentence }}
   Replace: {{ item.was }}{% if item.person %} (a {{ item.person }}){% endif %}
   Invented names: {{ item.candidates|join(", ") }}
{% endfor %}
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>
<|SECTION:FORMAT|>
Reply with only one JSON object, shaped exactly like this example:
{"picks": [{"n": 1, "pick": "<one of its invented names>", "meaning": "owl town"}]}

One entry per item. No commentary, no markdown fences, just the JSON object.
